OL,3,GNEWSAInquests into police pursuit crash
OL,4,Adeaths open
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe opening of inquests into the deaths
OL,7,Fof two people killed when their car was
OL,8,Fhit by a vehicle being pursued by
OL,9,Fpolice has been told the pair died from
OL,10,Fhead, neck and chest injuries.
OL,12,FCameron Bell, 22, and 23-year-old Jade
OL,13,FLangton died as a result of the
OL,14,Fcollision at the junction of Gelderd
OL,15,FRoad and Lowfields Road in Leeds on 15
OL,16,FNovember.
OL,18,FWest Yorkshire Police previously said
OL,19,Fofficers were following a blue BMW 123D
OL,20,Fwhen it failed to stop and crashed into
OL,21,Fa white Volkswagen Scirocco, which the
OL,22,Fpair were travelling in.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
