OL,3,GNEWSAInquests into police pursuit crash
OL,4,Adeaths open
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Wakefield Coroner's Court, coroner
OL,7,FOliver Longstaff said Bell, of
OL,8,FCranbrook Road, York, and Langton, of
OL,9,FYew Tree Close, York, also suffered
OL,10,Foblique, or abdominal, injuries.
